      <div type="clause" n="21">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 21</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be ðæm ðe for ordale ðingiaþ.] [Ld] Gif hwa þingie for ordal, ðingie on ðam ceapgilde þæt he mæge, ⁊ noht on ðam wite, buton hit se gifan wille þe hit togebyrige.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone compounds for an ordeal, he shall make what terms he can for the amount involved, but on no account shall he compound for the fine, unless he to whom it is due is willing to consent.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Be ðæm ðe for ordale ðingiaþ. Gif hwa ðingie for ordale, þingie on þam ceapgylde þæt he mæge, nawiht on ðam wite, butan se gyfan wille ðe hit togebyrige.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
